#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:59
msgid ""
"**Connected workspaces:** :doc:`Federated collaboration </administration-"
"guide/onboard/connected-workspaces>` across partner networks, with "
"seamless synchronization of messages, threads, and files."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:60
msgid ""
"**Guest Accounts:** :doc:`Secure participation </administration-"
"guide/onboard/guest-accounts>` of external mission partners with least-"
"privilege access. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:61
msgid ""
"**Matrix & XMPP Interoperability:** `Federation with legacy partner "
"systems <https://github.com/mattermost/mattermost-plugin-matrix-bridge>`_"
" for cross-domain coalition collaboration. *(Optional)*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:63
msgid "**Client Applications:**"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:65
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Desktop Apps:** Access Mattermost directly by deploying "
":doc:`desktop </deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment>` or web "
"apps in your organization."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:66
msgid ""
"**Mattermost Mobile Apps:** Access Mattermost via :doc:`iPhone and "
"Android apps </deployment-guide/mobile/mobile-app-deployment>`, with "
"support for :doc:`ID-only push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile"
"/host-your-own-push-proxy-service>` to ensure compliance with data "
"sovereignty requirements. *(Optional - not shown)*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:67
msgid ""
"**Microsoft 365 Desktop Apps:** For partnered organizations using "
"Microsoft 365 services, Teams and Outlook can be deployed with the "
