msgid "Calls services: Run multiple ``rtcd`` and offloader nodes for resilience."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:160
msgid "Sovereign audio & screensharing"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:162
msgid ""
"Deploy :doc:`Mattermost Calls </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"deployment-guide>` in a self-hosted configuration to ensure voice and "
"screen sharing capabilities remain operational without reliance on the "
"internet, and that media traffic does not traverse non-compliant third-"
"party services."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:164
msgid ""
"The ``rtcd`` service, configured using the :doc:`RTCD Setup and "
"Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-rtcd-setup>` guide, "
"provides scalable, low-latency media routing hosted on-premises. Run "
"multiple ``rtcd`` nodes for redundancy."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:165
msgid ""
"The ``calls-offloader`` service, configured using the :doc:`Calls "
"Offloader Setup and Configuration </administration-guide/configure/calls-"
"offloader-setup>` guide, offloads heavy processing tasks like recording, "
"transcription and live captioning to a compliance-approved job server."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:168
msgid "Compliance and retention"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:170
msgid ""
"Sovereign environments often require strict enforcement of retention "
"policies, legal hold, and export controls. Configure Mattermost's built-"
"in compliance features to meet organizational mandates."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:172
msgid ""
"Enable :doc:`compliance export </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"export>` and :doc:`monitoring </administration-guide/comply/compliance-"
"monitoring>` to produce auditable exports of message data and user "
"activity logs."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:173
msgid ""
"Configure :doc:`message retention </administration-guide/comply/data-"
"retention-policy>` and :doc:`legal hold </administration-guide/comply"
"/legal-hold>` policies to align with applicable regulations."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:174
msgid ""
"Integrate with your organization's :doc:`eDiscovery </administration-"
"guide/comply/electronic-discovery>` and archiving systems as required."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:177
msgid "Mobile notifications"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/reference-architecture/deployment-scenarios/deploy-mission-partner.rst:179
msgid ""
"To prevent sensitive message content from being transmitted to external "
"notification services such as Apple Push Notification Service (APNS) and "
"Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM), configure Mattermost to use :doc:`ID-only"
" push notifications </deployment-guide/mobile/host-your-own-push-proxy-"
"service>`. In this mode, only a message identifier is sent to public push"
" notification services, and the client retrieves the content securely "
"from the Mattermost server over an encrypted channel."
msgstr ""

